          SEG

          MOVE W I H'7FFFFFFF', R0
          ADD W I 1, R0, R1

          MOVE W I H'80000000', R2
          SUB W I 1, R2, R3

          MOVE W I 0, R4
          SUB W I 1, R4, R5

          MOVE W I H'FFFFFFFF', R6
          ADD W I 1, R6, R7

          MOVE W I 10, R8
          CMP W I 10, R8

          MOVE W I 5, R9
          CMP W I 10, R9

          MOVE W I 15, R10
          CMP W I 10, R10

          MOVE W I -5, R11
          CMP W I 5, R11

          HALT
          END
